&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;e9a004a15115&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;Your Role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;07590f979499&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;As part of the larger Engineering department, the Core Network team builds and operates the heart of emnify&#39;s SuperNetwork — the mobile core that keeps millions of IoT devices connected across 180+ countries. As we evolve our platform towards a cloud-native **5G Standalone (SA)** core, we&#39;re looking for a hands-on 5G SA expert to help us design, build, and run it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;8b9e27db5f99&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;As a Staff engineer with deep 5G SA expertise, you&#39;ll take technical ownership of the core network functions and roaming scenarios that make global IoT connectivity work. You&#39;ll set the technical direction for our 5G SA core while staying hands-on — designing, implementing, testing, and troubleshooting the software components that run in production at scale. You&#39;ll partner closely with engineers across squads, share your expertise, and raise the bar for how we build cloud-native telecommunications software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;28811f1469b0&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;This is a hybrid position based at emnify’s Berlin office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;dd7ef8d4dd20&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your Impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a7187a78fc6e&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;bulletList&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;8336d6580118&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;fb0837183468&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll architect, design and build using AI-agentic workflows software components for emnify’s cloud native 5G Standalone core in C++, Go, or Java — implementing and operating network functions (NFs) and the service-based interfaces between them and integrating into the overall emnify platform OSS and BSS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;c542f84a7958&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;783153ae0055&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll own 5G roaming scenarios end-to-end, designing and implementing the signaling and interworking that keep IoT devices connected as they move across networks and borders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;cc06fbff0ba2&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;380af69b0e12&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll help deploy and operate the 5G core at scale on AWS and Kubernetes, building for high availability, observability, and performance across regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;eff5c16e1e0c&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;46786ce81b26&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll set technical direction and raise engineering standards across teams — mentoring engineers, reviewing designs, and driving decisions on protocols, network functions, and core architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;81b6e227651f&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;8f291c1b27a3&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll troubleshoot complex, live telecommunications issues across the stack, from core network protocols down to the running service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;0fb55f665005&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we expect&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;94fec8aaac8b&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;bulletList&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;747a5386ba68&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;dbf69dcff74b&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Deep, hands-on expertise with the **5G Standalone core**: core specifications and core signalling protocols (e.g. service-based interfaces over HTTP/2, Diameter, GTP-C/U), roaming scenarios, core network protocols, and network functions (NFs). Our focus is the mobile core network domain; hands-on experience with 5G RAN technologies is not a requirement for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;3edce0de-c76b-47ec-a496-af9b558ffc2a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;dc44b5b484d8&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience with cloud-native networking, service mesh, and observability for high-throughput distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;425f8ce1f5c4&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;6fcd6a7b4c2b&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;**Hands-on software engineering is essential.** You can architect/design, implement, test, and troubleshoot software components using AI-agentic workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;aca569682990&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;73d5c8e70a24&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Strong software development experience in at least one of **C++, Go, or Java** combined with a results-oriented mindset and readiness to work across the technology stack when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;7f14be1ae496&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;093e52425888&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience with large-scale infrastructure deployment and orchestration (**AWS, Kubernetes**).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;1d30a89be5a5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;4419f32408d4&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Proven experience running **telecommunications services at scale** in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;e87dc770a2c3&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;**Bonus points:**&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;abb2fa1a971d&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;bulletList&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;be6b77ec9658&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;06a541b4af6e&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Background in IoT/M2M connectivity or MVNO/MNO core network operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;9ad3d4d86b1d&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Why emnify?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;8026dd072107&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;emnify is a global **IoT connectivity platform provider**, enabling enterprises and OEMs to build, deploy, and operate connected products at scale across 180+ countries. Our cloud-native SuperNetwork powers mission-critical use cases in industries such as mobility, logistics, energy, and industrial IoT.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;5d888bffd1c0&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We are a **Series-B scale-up** with a strong growth trajectory and a clear focus on upmarket and enterprise customers. emnify&#39;s technology and innovation have been recognized repeatedly by the industry, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ea0d7c70b5be&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;bulletList&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;1cd0bd4108d4&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;82fd21b8329e&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;**eSIM Provider of the Year** at the *MVNOs World Awards 2025*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;8734cbb0fbed&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;c475b5b1b099&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;**Platinum Award** for *eSIM Management Platform Innovation* by *Juniper Research (2025)*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ccc820205739&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;1e97d72c51c3&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;**IoT Innovator Award** by *Compass Intelligence* for aviation connectivity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;5f8cddcb43fe&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
