&lt;li&gt;Security and compliance awareness: You understand the importance of PCI, data privacy, and secure-by-design principles in payment systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration under pressure: You thrive in problem-solving moments, communicate clearly, and contribute to quick resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous learning: You’re curious about how things connect across the platform, eager to learn from peers, and open to sharing your own knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinking: You see beyond the task, understanding how architectural decisions impact scalability, costs, and long-term flexibility.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
